{"title":"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/4/f149f31faba8e7d4ae0c22c860a4de074873d1a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + B = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />, then the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/0/500e0798280af9b1d3e003083410fd47185ea9eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B - 3 + A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340176ac2fb9f78ba4aa80255a3d9ad2f597c8a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 15 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"406\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To make the problem easier, we can rearrange the terms in the expression to see that the expression is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/2/682b78ebd8d1eaf549f0918c22cf077d9d98490e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + B - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />. We can now see that we can plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/4/f149f31faba8e7d4ae0c22c860a4de074873d1a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + B = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" /> into the expression:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/c/bec8a614a37b6f22f719d304c02ffd9c4e000acb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + B - 3 = 5 - 3 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"229\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal\">2006 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" 